# sweep: --bare
# The table tools: the order of battle from empty to ended, a party member's
# health, saves and slots, and both surviving a restart.
wait-for Grimoire
tap Initiative
expect No combatants
expect Add a name and an initiative, or add a monster from its reference.
clean
shot initiative-empty
tap Add combatant
type ana
tap-id kb.enter
type 15
tap-id kb.enter
type 30
tap-id kb.enter
wait-for ana
expect Initiative 15 · HP 30/30 · taking this turn
tap Add
type bo
tap-id kb.enter
type 8
tap-id kb.enter
wait-for Hit points, or leave blank
type 12
tap-id kb.enter
wait-for bo
tap Add
type cy
tap-id kb.enter
type 20
tap-id kb.enter
# Putting the keyboard away empty asks which was meant; Type hit points
# opens the digits again.
tap-id kb.enter
tap Type hit points
expect Hit points, or leave blank
tap-id kb.enter
tap Leave hit points blank
# The list is sorted by initiative and the turn stays with whoever had it.
wait-for cy
expect Round 1 · turn 2 of 3
expect Initiative 15 · HP 30/30 · taking this turn
clean
shot initiative-three
tap Next turn
expect Round 1 · turn 3 of 3
tap Next turn
expect Round 2 · turn 1 of 3
# Previous from the first combatant takes the round back with it.
tap Previous
expect Round 1 · turn 3 of 3
# A combatant's own screen: damage, taking the turn, a fixed roll, removal.
tap bo
expect Combatant
expect HP
expect 12/12
tap-id hp-down-10
expect 2/12
tap-id hp-down-5
expect 0/12
tap-id hp-up
expect 1/12
clean
shot combatant-hurt
tap Take the turn
expect Initiative 8 · HP 1/12 · taking this turn
tap bo
tap Edit
expect Name
tap-id kb.enter
expect Initiative
tap-id kb.backspace
type 25
tap-id kb.enter
# The same maximum keeps the damage taken.
tap-id kb.enter
wait-for Round 1
expect Initiative 25 · HP 1/12 · taking this turn
tap cy
expect-missing HP
tap Remove
expect-missing cy
expect turn 1 of 2
# Initiative is saved after every change.
restart
wait-for Grimoire
tap Initiative
expect Initiative 25 · HP 1/12 · taking this turn
expect ana
expect turn 1 of 2
clean
shot initiative-restarted
tap End combat
expect No combatants
tap-id 4294967295
# A party member: hit points in steps, death saves and spell slots.
tap Party
expect No party members
expect Tap Add to enter a name, AC, and hit points.
tap Add member
type moss
tap-id kb.enter
type 14
tap-id kb.enter
type 20
tap-id kb.enter
type 20
tap-id kb.enter
wait-for moss
tap Add member
type fern
tap-id kb.enter
type 12
tap-id kb.enter
type 30
tap-id kb.enter
type 25
tap-id kb.enter
wait-for fern
expect AC 12 · HP 25/30
clean
shot party-two
tap moss
expect Party member
tap-id hp-down-10
tap-id hp-down-10
tap-id hp-down
expect 0/20
tap-id hp-up-10
expect 10/20
tap Success
tap Success
tap Failure
expect 2 success · 1 failure
clean
shot member-saves
# The slots are on the member's second page.
tap-id next
tap Set up
expect After 4 it goes back to none.
tap-id slot-1
tap-id slot-1
tap-id slot-1
expect 2nd · 3 of 3 left
tap Spend
tap-id slot-1
tap-id slot-1
expect 2nd · 1 of 3 left
tap Regain
tap-id slot-1
expect 2nd · 2 of 3 left
clean
shot member-slots
tap-id previous
expect 10/20
# Edit keeps what is not retyped.
tap Edit
tap-id kb.enter
tap-id kb.backspace
tap-id kb.backspace
type 16
tap-id kb.enter
tap-id kb.enter
tap-id kb.enter
wait-for AC 16 · HP 10/20
restart
wait-for Grimoire
tap Party
expect AC 16 · HP 10/20
tap moss
expect 2 success · 1 failure
tap-id next
expect 2nd · 2 of 3 left
tap Party
# Each member opens their own page, whichever was opened before.
tap fern
expect Party member
expect 25/30
clean
shot member-second
tap Remove
expect-missing fern
expect moss
